{title: Jo Wada Kiya Woh}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Lata Mangeshkar Roshan Taj Mahal}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Jo Wada Kiya Wo [D]Nibhana Pa [G]dega,        [G]Roke Zamaana Chahe Roke [Em]Khudaai
Tumko [Am]Aanaa Pa [D]degaa,        [G]Jo Waada Kiya Woh [D]Nibhana Pa [G]dega..
[G]Tarasti Nigaho Ne [Em]Aawaaz [G]Di Hai,        [G]Muhabbat Ki Raho Ne Aawaz Di Hai..
[D]Aaa [G]aaa,        [G]Jan-E-Haya Jan-E- [D]Ada Chhodo Tar [G]sana
Tumko [D]Aanaa Padegaa,        Jo [G]Waada Kiya Woh [D]Nibhana Pa [G]dega
[G]Ye Mana Hume Jaan Se [D]Janaa Pa [G]dega
Par Ye [G]Samajh Lo Tumne [Em]Jab Bhi Pukara,        Humko [Am]Aanaa Pa [D]dega
Jo [G]Waada Kiya Woh [D]Nibhana Pa [G]dega,        [G]Hum Apni Wafaa Pe Naa [Em]Ilzaam [G]Lenge
[G]Tumhein Dil Diya Hai Tumhe Jaan Bhi Denge,        [D]Aaa [G]aaa
[G]Jab Ishq Ka Sauda [D]Kiya Phir Kya Ghab [G]rana
Tumko [D]Aanaa Padegaa,        Jo [G]Waada Kiya Woh [D]Nibhana Pa [G]dega
[G]Chamakte Hai Jab Tak Ye [Em]Chand Aur [G]Tare,        [G]Na Tootenge Ehad-O-Paimaan Hamaare
[D]Aaa [G]aaa,        [G]Ik Dusraa Jab De [D]Sadaa Hoke Dee [G]wana
Hamko [D]Aanaa Padegaa,        Jo [G]Waada Kiya Woh [D]Nibhana Pa [G]dega
